  "date_patterns": ["(?P<y>\\d{4})-(?P<m>\\d{2})-(?P<d>\\d{2})", "(?P<d>\\d{1,2})/(?P<m>\\d{1,2})/(?P<y>\\d{4}|\\d{2})\\b", "(?P<d>\\d{1,2})(?:er)?\\s(?P<mon>[a-zéû]{3,9}\\.?)\\s(?P<y>\\d{4})"],
  "notes": "Dates are day first (05/03/2026). The first of the month is written 1er. Thousands are separated by a space, a no-break space or a narrow no-break space; the currency follows the amount (1 234,56 €).",
